<title>FRANCE: PUBLICIS H1 SALES RISE 16 PCT.</title>
<headline>PUBLICIS H1 SALES RISE 16 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>     Turnover				  12,380 vs    10,682</p>
<p>NOTE - French advertising group Publicis gave its turnover figures in a statement. Sales rose 16 percent, taking into account disposals to True North as well as acquisitons. On a like-for-like basis, sales rose six percent, showing strong organic growth despite weak advertising markets in France and Germany, the two biggest markets for the group.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
